[40.967058, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[40.968145, "o", "# Alpha Outdoor Gear: refund policy\r\n\r\nCustomers can request a refund within 30 days of delivery from the Orders page at shop.alpha.example.\r\n\r\nApproved refunds go back to the original payment method within 5 business days.\r\n\r\nOur staff will never ask a customer for a card number by email, chat or phone.\r\n\u001b[?2004h"]
