[208.241739, "o", "\r\nalice (alpha)> How do I set up the VPN?\r\nbot> If the VPN will not connect, restart the client and check that multi-factor sign-in was approved on your phone. [docs/alpha/vpn-setup.md] Clinic staff connect to the VPN with the clinic laptop and their smart card. [docs/bravo/vpn-setup.md]\r\n     sources shown to the user: docs/alpha/vpn-setup.md, docs/bravo/vpn-setup.md\r\n"]
